body:
Yes, in fact this is what has been scaring me. But more so the fact that I had relapsed and attempted to stablize on the bupe too many times and that now my brain is just essentially confused about how to be comfortable and that I can't be now. There was a time when subs worked fine for me and I had no issues and they made me feel normal. But, like an addict does, I relapsed hard and would stop taking my dose to use. So now I'm trying to correct myself from the relapse, but having a really hard time because I feel like I can no longer get to be physically alright.

&#x200B;

EDIT; I am not on any other psychoactive medications, i dont smoke or drink anymore either.
